(text "C134 is an approved Y1 capacitor; ordinary MLCC substitution prohibited.\nThe RJ45 shield connects to the accessible secondary ground.\nKeep all primary copper clear of secondary copper and mounting hardware.\nPoE bridge / PD / isolated conversion: integration remains in progress.\nEnforce the isolation barrier in PCB rules, including inner layers." (at 157.48 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f5be86e3-83b0-5e11-8ebe-be4cecfcf7c0"))
